 "applies_to": "Acutherm E-Series interoperable VAV diffusers (thermal-electric and motorized units) with BACnet MS/TP.",
 "summary": "E-Series diffusers are self-contained VAV diffusers that can run stand-alone or take commands over BACnet MS/TP. The object list has 44 objects: room, supply air and airflow readings, effective setpoint and terminal load, occupied/unoccupied/standby setpoints and flow limits, BMS overrides for occupancy, heat/cool mode, setpoint, room and supply temperature, airflow and damper position, and diagnostics.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
